<!-- ABOUT PAGE -->
<style>
  .custom-page-wrapper {
    padding: 150px 5% 100px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    min-height: 80vh;
  }
  .custom-page-title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 100px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: #888;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .custom-page-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .custom-page-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>

<div class="custom-page-wrapper">
  <div class="section-label">— /// OUR STORY</div>
  <h1 class="custom-page-title">ABOUT US</h1>
  <div class="custom-page-content">
    {% if page.content != blank %}
      {{ page.content }}
    {% else %}
      <h3 style="color:var(--accent); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-family:'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800;">WE ARE NEW. WE ARE REAL.</h3>

      <p>DAILY/SCROLL is a new and growing online store — and we believe in being completely honest with you about that. We are not a faceless corporation with thousands of reviews. We are a small, passionate team who genuinely cares about every single order that goes out.</p>

      <p>We started this store because we were tired of the same overpriced, low-quality products everywhere online. So we decided to build something different — a curated shop where <strong style="color:var(--text-primary);">every product is hand-picked, personally tested, and held to a high standard</strong> before it ever reaches you.</p>

      <p>Being new means we have everything to prove — and that is exactly why we work harder than anyone. Your trust is not taken for granted here. Every order, every message, every return is handled personally and professionally.</p>

      <h3 style="color:var(--accent); margin: 2rem 0 1rem; font-family:'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 1.6rem; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800;">OUR PROMISE TO YOU</h3>
      <p>🛡️ <strong>30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</strong> — Full refund, no questions asked.<br/>
      📦 <strong>Free Worldwide Shipping</strong> — Tracked and insured on every order.<br/>
      🔒 <strong>Secure Checkout</strong> — Powered by Shopify's bank-grade encryption.<br/>
      ⚡ <strong>Fast Support</strong> — We respond within 24 hours. Always.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--accent);">"Curated for excellence. Trusted by thousands."</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>
